{"id":"1e7f22030c79f92b","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-kurtz-null-test.md","title":"Kurtz 有限闭开零检验","display":"df-kurtz-null-test — Kurtz 有限闭开零检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-kurtz-null-test","aliases":["43-df-kurtz-null-test"],"display":"df-kurtz-null-test — Kurtz 有限闭开零检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.2，印刷233，PDF253","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-kurtz-null-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-kurtz-null-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kurtz-null-test — Kurtz 有限闭开零检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.2，印刷233，PDF253"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\#_2:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 的有效双射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 均见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_e\">\\(E_e\\)</span> 由下式构造为有限串集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的值是自然数代码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}\\)</span> 是序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_e\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\lfloor e/2^{\\#_2(\\sigma)}\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_e\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\lfloor e/2^{\\#_2(\\sigma)}\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限性须统一可计算地给出，不能只要求每个分量在拓扑上闭开。本轮把有限串集合与自然数代码明确分开：e只有有限多个非零二进制位，故E_e有限，且每个有限串集合有唯一代码。TotalComputable现在只作用于自然数域的f；KurtzNullTest的外部签名与数学含义保持不变。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.5.1 Definition 10.5.2，印刷233，PDF253。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\#_2:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的有效双射；$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 均见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$E_e$ 由下式构造为有限串集合，$f$ 的值是自然数代码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\#_2:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的有效双射；$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 均见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$E_e$ 由下式构造为有限串集合，$f$ 的值是自然数代码。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\#_2:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的有效双射；$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]，柱集与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 均见 [[43-df-cylinder]]。$E_e$ 由下式构造为有限串集合，$f$ 的值是自然数代码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\#_2:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"E_e","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"E_e\\coloneqq\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\lfloor e/2^{\\#_2(\\sigma)}\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}(U)\\iff\\exists f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left(U_n=\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\land\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{\\sigma\\in E_{f(n)}}[\\sigma]\\right)\\le2^{-n}\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[{"id":"6653f26a3d0abcec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$X\\in2^\\omega$；$U,V\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。$E_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}$ 采用 [[43-df-kurtz-null-test]] 的有限串代码；$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}^A$、$\\Pi^{0,A}_1\\operatorname{Class}$、$\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]、[[43-df-pi01class]]、[[43-df-kurtzrandom]]。$\\mu$ 为 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的Cantor空间公平硬币Borel概率测度，满足 $\\mu([\\sigma])=2^{-|\\sigma|}$。本节引入相对检验 $\\mathrm{KurtzNullTest}^A$、相对随机性 $\\mathrm{KurtzRandom}^A$ 及两个一元低性谓词 $\\mathrm{LowForKurtz}$、$\\mathrm{LowForKurtzTest}$。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]] — Kurtz 有限闭开零检验"},{"id":"959b7a3f4e264cd5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$；定义见 [[43-df-kurtzrandom]]、[[43-df-kurtz-null-test]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","ab1ef7b1cac112c1","8e999d59227f4a28","aa33e0ea8422ba2a"]}